  "details": "**The Problem**\n\nNew players can be overwhelmed by hateful speech when joining VRChat for the first time.\n\nThis might be due to popular worlds being shown first. As experienced players know, public worlds have a unique feel that could potentially drive away new users unfamiliar with the platform.\n\n**Approaching a solution**\n\nI have one suggestion that might lead to a solution. Perhaps creating a new default sort, \"recommended\", based on a simple heuristic. This sort would show only instances with only 2-3 players. This might lead new players toward a more relaxed stage suitable for having genuine conversations.",
